  {
   "id": 520391,
   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Maintaining body heat is important for maintaining body functions in animals. Which of the following statements provides an example of how an animal can actively generate body heat?",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1016969,
     "content_html": "Triglycerides are used to store energy for later use."
    },
    {
     "id": 1016970,
     "content_html": "An animal produces metabolic waste energy in the form of heat."
    },
    {
     "id": 1016971,
     "content_html": "An animal has insulation, which helps it maintain a constant body temperature."
    },
    {
     "id": 1016972,
     "content_html": "An animal eats a large amount of high-fat foods to produce adipose tissue."
    }
   ],
